tail made his way to the back. He pulled on his tail and watched it snap back into him, leaving no trace of its existance behind. Then, he began to swing his hips in a circle till they and his ass became curved, but muscular. Now came the hard part. Reaching down to his member, he pushed it back into himself, grunting as it went inside to form a fake clit.</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:green\"><i>&quot;Jesus, that hurts,&quot;</i></span><i> he gasped, wiping sweat from his brow. </i><span style=\"color:green\"><i>&quot;Alright, now for the kith.&quot;</i></span><br /> <br /> <i>Focusing as hard as he could, Jace felt his fur retract under his skin, which became green and smooth. Pushing on his nose, he felt his muzzle turn into an orc's snout, as two tiny tusks poked out from his feminine lips. His hair became rich brown, lengthening till it reached his shoulders. And after pushing his adam's apple back into his throat, he completed his gender transformation.</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:green\"><i>&quot;Hey there, big boy,&quot;</i></span><i> he said sweetly to the mirror with a teen girl's voice. </i><span style=\"color:green\"><i>&quot;I'm Susie. Susie Armstrong. Can I be on <i>your</i> team?&quot;</i></span><br /> <br /> <i>Chuckling at his genius, Jace began to dress up in his chosen clothes. Hoisting up the jiggle bra before putting on the bubble-gum shirt, panties, and shorts.</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:green\"><i>&quot;Hmm... it's missing something,&quot;</i></span><i> he reasoned with a finger to his chin. Then he came with an idea, and made a single braid of hair beside his ear.</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:green\"><i>&quot;Perfect.&quot;</i></span></div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>nWoD Warhammer Fantasy RPG,<br /> WoD Wraith: The Oblivion<br /> and Infernum-style Demon: The Descent, Shadows of Abaddon --&gt; <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php/